Z||000000||mrfiero||02-10-2001||06:07 PM||||First of all I want to thank Jeff (Black88GT)......without his help I don't think I would have ever gotten my coilover kit.  They just arrived today via Priority Mail.......thanks Jeff.<P><BR>Here's the story........way back in November I ordered a set of Ground Control coilovers from Mike LeCompte (HYPTNOTiSE).  I sent him $250 cash and a brand new set of KYB struts.  $200 of it was for the coilovers, $20 for return shipping & $30 to modify my struts (I didn't want to risk messing them up).<P>In late December I was told that they were in and would be shipping soon.  Weeks went by and several unanswered e-mails later I still did not have my coilovers.  Mike e-mailed me once, about 3 weeks ago and I have not heard from him since.  That's where Jeff comes in.......he agreed to send out the coilovers to me (and everyone else who ordered them).  I again say thanks Jeff.<P>Unfortunately I am still not very satisfied or pleased.  Why, you ask?  The struts that were sent to me are used!!  They are not the brand new ones that I sent.......It's possible that they got mixed up, but I have a funny feeling someone pulled a switchy-changey.<P>Jeff, LMK if my new struts are around and if this was a just mix-up.  I am in no way blaming you for anything.......like I said, without your help I wouldn't have anything. <P>LMK what you can find out from Mike.<P>Thanks again.||||reg||13
