Z||000005||Black88GT||02-10-2001||11:26 PM||||I was just thinking if I was in your guys' shoes I would want what I paid for ASAP, and I didn't want you to think Mike was a bad guy which he is not, he's just having personal problems and he needed a little help.  <P><BR>glad to help...<P><BR>p.s. Sean I sent yours to "fantasy gifts" I guess thats where you work, so they should be there by now...<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||14
