Z||000019||danny boy||02-22-2001||10:19 PM|||| I know I have posted this pic already, but here it is again. they are from Dave Held. It was Ryanne when I got them.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/brakes_and_coilovers_2.jpg"> <P>The kit consists of strut adapters, springs,sleeves, and perches. They fit snug, but Ryanne recommended using formagasket to seal them to the strut. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stealth_feb2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
